      "text": "Day 16 - Project, and Axios Interceptop:\nToday i created ecomm  project using data routing, react-hook-form, toastify\napi with axios instance, responce design for all devices. i craeted login, registration\nwith validation in registration full name, email, passowrd, and in login email and password\nfor login, i used store logged user and registered use in localstore. \ni use public route for prevent logged user not go on login page and proteted for\nnot registered user not go on main page. I cared home page, to show about e-comm \nproject data, product page for show product and user page to show users. I used \ndummyjson api for users and products. I created config folder insdie I wrote axiosInstance.jsx\nand created export const axiosInstance = axios.create({\n  baseURL: \"https://dummyjson.com\",\n});\nand call axiosInstanct productPage and userPage. and use map for disaply usercard and productcard\nalso I added login, register, logout, functionality. disaply user card all details like first, last name\nemail, address, phone, and on product card name, image, category, price, rating, reviews,\ndescription and add to card button. also i created custom hook for same form funcationality\nabout register and login form so add create authhook.jsx and store same code and pass into\nregister page and login page.  \n\n\n",
